  },
  "section": "3.5",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the following traits from the Core Barbarian Traits table: Hit Point Die, proficiency with Martial weapons, and training with Shields.  \n- Gain the Barbarian's level 1 features, which are listed in the Barbarian Features table."
}
